'''Galapa-Goth''' (ガラ・パ・ゴス ''Gara Pa Gosu'', '''Gala-Pa-Goth''') is the 31st sub-chapter of [[Stories of Legend]]. It was added in [[Version 5.3 Update|Version 5.3]] and is available up to {{4c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
This sub-chapter is about as hard as the previous one. Challenging stages can be [[DNA & DHA]], [[Surviving Herd]], and [[Heavenly Creatures]]. The other stages will be easy with the right strategies and shouldn't provide much of a challenge, the easiest stage is [[Alien Ecology]] due to the quite simple cheese that can be done for it.
{{LegendDiff|120|140|100}}

==New features==
This sub-chapter introduces one new enemy:
*[[Henry]]: An [[wikipedia:Anglerfish|anglerfish]] with low damage, very high health and the ability to freeze cats from safe range. If not dealt with properly, he can perma freeze your cats but can't hit them in his (fairly large) blind spot.

