==Trivia==
*Galapa-Goth is a reference to the [[wikipedia:Galápagos Islands|Galápagos Islands]], an island group in Ecuador famous for inspiring [[wikipedia:Charles Darwin|Charles Darwin]]'s theory of evolution by natural selection.
**Incidentally, Galapa-Goth is the 31st [[Stories of Legend]] sub-chapter, and the 31st [[Zero Legends]] sub-chapter, [[Eden of Evolution]], features [[Sage of Selection Darvin]], who is directly based on Charles Darwin.
*Many stages reference ecology or zoology, like [[Conservation Society]].

